<title>INDIA: India Procter bonus share meet on Aug 21.</title>
<headline>India Procter bonus share meet on Aug 21.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Procter &amp; Gamble India Ltd. will meet on August 21 to consider a bonus share issue, a company spokesperson told Reuters on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;We have sent a notice to the Bombay Stock Exchange regarding the bonus meeting,&quot; the spokesperson said.</p>
<p>The company will also meet to consider accounts and dividend for the year ending June 30, 1997 on August 21, the spokesperson added.</p>
<p>Procter &amp; Gamble India Ltd. is a subsidiary of Procter &amp; Gamble Company of the U.S.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
